Z||000007||annieL||09-12-2001||10:07 PM||||I saw a show on black boxes about 2 weeks ago. These things are virtually impossible to break. They can be submerged in water and still keep all the information on them. The show said that they are made to withstand 5,000 degree heat.||||reg||1
